    "intro_html":  "\u003cp\u003eCool ranch, warm spice, and a number that stays in line. This burrito hits {{cal}} calories with {{protein}} grams of protein, on a tortilla carrying 18 grams of fiber for about 5 grams of net carb. The ranch here is a Greek yogurt sauce with real ranch stirred in, so you get the tang and the creaminess with a fraction of the fat a bottle of dressing brings. Fajita peppers, black beans, and a can of tomatoes with green chiles give it the southwestern backbone.\u003c/p\u003e",
